type: software
title: "loop-kit"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that answers questions from a knowledge base with an
  engineered draft, check, and revise loop. The caller brings documents and
  instructions; retrieval, prompts, the checker, citation validation, and the
  stop condition ship with the library.
